Prompt: Permanently Resolve Secure Chat Navigation and Conversation Opening Bug (Android)

In the Android version of QGuard Messaging, there is a critical issue in the Secure Chat module that prevents users from starting conversations.

Current Issue

When a user:

Opens Secure Chat
Searches for another registered user
Selects or taps that user from the search results

the application briefly displays "Opening...", but instead of navigating to the conversation screen, it immediately returns to the Search Users page.

As a result:

Users cannot open conversations.
Users cannot send or receive messages.
The Secure Chat feature is effectively unusable.
Expected Behavior

When a user taps another user from the search results:

Validate that the selected user exists.
Create a conversation if one does not already exist.
Reuse the existing conversation if one already exists.
Successfully navigate to the Secure Chat conversation screen.
Load all previous encrypted messages.
Allow sending and receiving messages immediately.
Never redirect back to the Search Users screen unless the user explicitly presses the Back button.
